      "id": "gathering-the-threads",
      "kind": "discovery",
      "title": "Threads of a Divine Grudge",
      "prose": "Piece by piece the town's fear takes shape: cultists in mourning-black have been buying up bell-metal and bribing gravediggers, all in service of waking Orune fully into the world to collect an ancient debt from his brother — paid in Sixnail Crossing's blood, if need be.",
      "art": "art-the-hollow-bell-frontier-gathering-threads-art",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "press-warden-ledger",
