    {
      "id": "ending-uneasy-peace",
      "kind": "ending",
      "title": "An Uneasy Peace",
      "prose": "Orune sleeps in silver chains beneath a rebuilt chapel, and Kest's banners fly a little brighter for it. Sixnail Crossing survives, watchful, its two gods still not speaking — but at least no longer screaming.",
