    {
      "id": "ending-broken-bell",
      "kind": "ending",
      "title": "The Broken Bell",
      "prose": "Without its anchor, Orune's grudge unravels into the wind and the valley reshapes itself overnight — new rivers, new hills, a town forced to remake its maps. Strange, but free.",
